/- A filtered colimit of henselian pairs is henselian along the ideal generated by the images of
the `I i` (Stacks Tag 0FWT): `TauCetiRoadmap.AdicEtaleGeometry.Ring.DirectLimit.henselianRing`,
here for a constant system with identity transition maps, whose colimit is the ring itself. -/
